## 1. Partial Storage Layout & Allocation

### Dtypes

| Buffer | Dtype | Template param |
|--------|-------|----------------|
| `out_accum` / `O_partial` | **fp32 always** | `ElementPartial = float` in epilogue; combine instantiated as `Tpartial = float` |
| `softmax_lse_accum` / `LSE_partial` | **fp32 always** | `float*` everywhere |
| Final `out` | bf16/fp16/fp32 | `Element` template param |
| Final `softmax_lse` | fp32 | written by combine |

