## 5. When Combine Is Skipped / Fast Paths

### Host level

| Condition | Behavior |
|-----------|----------|
| `num_splits == 1` | No `out_accum`/`softmax_lse_accum` allocated; `run_mha_fwd_combine` never called |
| `num_splits > 256` | `TORCH_CHECK` failure |
| Varlen + `batch > PREPARE_VARLEN_MAX_BATCHES_1CTA` (~992) | Split forced to 1 (line 1045) |
| Empty KV | `out.zero_()`, no combine |

